## Description

The organization directory lacked exact-membership deletion and dropped management evidence needed by later removal checks. S2.5-01a adds the portable contract and WorkOS implementation: normal void completion is applied, the documented no-effect refusal is unsupported, and other failures remain uncertain. Raw membership reads preserve missing/null evidence before the pinned SDK can default it to false.

No application route calls deletion. S2.5-01b still owns admission, current authority, serialization, and last-Admin safety.

## Review

Expected **T2 Need architect** for the changed shared declaration and internal provider binding. Final checker classification and metrics are pending.

Architecture facts so far:

- The public declaration of `organization-directory.ts` adds management facts and the deletion contract.

<details><summary>Declaration diff</summary>

```diff
diff --git a/docs/api-surface/src/accounts/organizations/organization-directory.d.ts b/docs/api-surface/src/accounts/organizations/organization-directory.d.ts
index 59fd7de3..d1f5e593 100644
--- a/docs/api-surface/src/accounts/organizations/organization-directory.d.ts
+++ b/docs/api-surface/src/accounts/organizations/organization-directory.d.ts
@@ -6,12 +6,14 @@ export interface OrganizationMembership {
     readonly grants: readonly RoleGrant[];
 }
 export type MembershipStatus = 'active' | 'inactive' | 'pending';
+export type MembershipManagement = 'ordinary' | 'external' | 'unknown';
 export interface OrganizationMember {
     readonly membershipId: string;
     readonly subject: string;
     readonly organizationId: string;
     readonly email: string;
     readonly status: MembershipStatus;
+    readonly management: MembershipManagement;
     readonly grants: readonly RoleGrant[];
     readonly revision: string;
 }
@@ -51,10 +53,14 @@ export interface InvitationSendResult {
 export interface InvitationUpdateResult {
     readonly outcome: 'applied' | 'not-pending' | 'unsupported';
 }
+export interface MembershipDeletionResult {
+    readonly outcome: 'applied' | 'unsupported';
+}
 export interface OrganizationDirectory {
     membershipsOf(user: AuthenticatedUser): Promise<readonly OrganizationMembership[]>;
     memberPage(request: MemberPageRequest): Promise<Page<OrganizationMember>>;
     member(membershipId: string): Promise<OrganizationMember | undefined>;
+    deleteMembership(membershipId: string): Promise<MembershipDeletionResult>;
     invitationPage(request: InvitationPageRequest): Promise<Page<OrganizationInvitation>>;
     invitation(invitationId: string): Promise<OrganizationInvitation | undefined>;
     sendInvitation(request: InvitationRequest): Promise<InvitationSendResult>;
```

</details>

The committed impact declaration records the internal interface and sensitive membership behavior. Components, dependency edges, registry diagrams, and deployment stay unchanged. Registry prose describes the required raw-reader binding and unused deletion boundary.

The acceptance-first sequence and independent review caught and fixed the SDK normalization edge case. The corrected full suite passes 4,827 backend and 49 portal tests; type checking, portal build, snapshots, and all 28 live WorkOS cases pass. Container/build gates and metrics remain in progress. Scoped live deletion proof remains S2.5-02.

Merge status: **blocked** by pending final checks and independent human architect approval of the final candidate.

